    skos:editorialNote "Curated classification (group=grp_industrial_minerals; processing_state=manufactured; land_basis=mineral): Lime here is burnt lime/plaster (Canadian 'Manufactures: Lime', 'Gypsum Plaster Lime &c'), a building mineral; classifier matched the citrus fruit 'lime'. Layer-1 observations: 111 rows, 1874–1897. Series: CSP_Canadian Trade and Navigation ×27; CSP_Canadian_Exports_BlankSeries (inferred, series not printed) ×84. Units: (no unit) ×111. Top routes: Quebec → All Countries ×18; Quebec → Newfoundland ×13; Quebec → United States ×9; Quebec → Great Britain ×5."@en ;
